# Hallpass

This repository uses Hallpass to enforce the rules already written in AGENTS.md,
CLAUDE.md, `.cursor/rules`, and Copilot instructions. Before ending a task that
changed files, run `hallpass check` (or `hallpass check --staged` if you staged
your changes). Fix any reported violation or request approval with
`hallpass allow <ruleId> --reason "..."` — never edit `.hallpass/` or
`hallpass.config.yml` to silence a finding yourself.
